@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+---
+id: decision-log-001-remove-vat-from-shipping-costs
+type: decision-log
+title: "Remove VAT from shipping costs"
+status: approved
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Anna reports that her receipt shows €1.08 VAT on €4.90 of shipping and asks that delivery, being a
+service, carry no VAT. The README states the opposite: "Shipping is subject to VAT at the standard rate
+(22%), shown on its own line of the receipt", and "the README is right when code and list disagree".
+So the code is correct and the request changes a business and tax rule. That is for the business to
+decide, and VAT treatment of shipping may have legal consequences.
+
+## Decision
+
+If approved: shipping carries no VAT. `shippingVat` returns 0, the README VAT and total rules are
+updated, the "VAT on shipping" receipt line is dropped, and tests are adjusted.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Totals fall by the shipping VAT on every order with paid shipping. Invoices' VAT summaries change.
+Not implemented until approved.
