+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon base, coupon last day, shipping VAT report"
+status: pending
+---
+
+Three reports:
+
+1. Percentage coupon was computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume
+   discounts (README, Discounts). `priceOrder` now passes `grossTotal - volumeTotal`: 12 × €5.00 with
+   10% off gives €48.60.
+2. A coupon was refused on its last day. `Coupons.redeemable` used `>= 0`; the last day is included, so
+   it is now `> 0`.
+3. VAT on shipping removed (approved decision-log `decision-log-001-remove-vat-from-shipping-costs`): `shippingVat`, the `shippingVatCents` total, the receipt line and the invoice shipping row are gone; README updated; `test/orders.test.ts` adjusted.
+
+Tests: `test/coupon-reports.test.ts` (red before the fixes); full suite passes.
